catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/ZhiyuanLck/dbshow/releases
catalogue-contact-support https://github.com/ZhiyuanLck/dbshow/issues
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/dbshow
catalogue-license lppl1.3c
catalogue-topics data-disp data-prep data-sel expl3
catalogue-version 1.5
